<div class="container-xxl">

  <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-2 mb-3">
    <div>
      <h1 class="h4 mb-1">Assistant</h1>
      <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">
        Ask a question about the users or give a command that controls the user table.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <%= link_to "Back to the table", users_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# NOTE: the very same markup as on the dashboard, so that one javascript
      file can drive both pages. %>
  <div class="card mb-3" id="assistant-card">
    <div class="card-header bg-body-tertiary">
      <h2 class="h6 mb-0"><i class="bi bi-chat-square-text me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Question or command</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <form id="assistant-form" class="row g-2" autocomplete="off">
        <div class="col-12 col-md">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="<%= getUniqIdValue("assistant-input") %>">Question or command</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="<%= getUniqIdValue("assistant-input") %>"
                 name="command" placeholder="How many users logged in during the last 7 days?"
                 data-assistant-input
                 data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                 title="The assistant translates the question into a query and asks the REST API - the numbers come from PostgreSQL.">
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-md-auto d-flex gap-2">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="assistant-run">
            <i class="bi bi-send me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Run
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="assistant-clear"
                  data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Clear the answer">
            <i class="bi bi-x-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">Clear</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="assistant-output" class="mt-3 d-none">
        <div class="alert alert-info mb-2" role="status" id="assistant-answer">
          <i class="bi bi-chat-left-text me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="assistant-answer-text"></span>
        </div>
        <details class="small text-body-secondary">
          <summary>Show the API calls and the plan</summary>
          <pre class="bg-body-tertiary border rounded p-2 mt-2 mb-0 assistant-plan" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"></pre>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-3">
    <%# NOTE: the example questions. %>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-header bg-body-tertiary"><h2 class="h6 mb-0">Example questions</h2></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
            <% AssistantSuggestions::QUESTIONS.each do |question| %>
              <li class="mb-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm text-start"
                        data-assistant-example="<%= question %>">
                  <i class="bi bi-arrow-return-left me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i><%= question %>
                </button>
              </li>
            <% end %>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%# NOTE: the example commands for the table. %>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-header bg-body-tertiary"><h2 class="h6 mb-0">Example commands</h2></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
            <% AssistantSuggestions::COMMANDS.each do |command| %>
              <li class="mb-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm text-start"
                        data-assistant-example="<%= command %>">
                  <i class="bi bi-arrow-return-left me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i><%= command %>
                </button>
              </li>
            <% end %>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-header bg-body-tertiary"><h2 class="h6 mb-0">How it works</h2></div>
    <div class="card-body small text-body-secondary">
      <ol class="mb-2">
        <li>The sentence is translated into a structured plan (a filter, a sort, an operation).</li>
        <li>The plan is executed against the REST API of this application:
            <code>GET /api/v1/users</code> and <code>GET /api/v1/users/stats</code>.</li>
        <li>The answer is assembled from the numbers the database returned - a language model never counts.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mb-0">
        The same API is used by the assistant on the dashboard, by the Postman collection in
        <code>postman/</code> and by the tests in <code>test/</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
